---

### Examples

> He is **in danger**. ✅

> This product is **in demand**. ✅

> I did it **by mistake**. ✅

> Explain the matter **in detail**. ✅

> **In conclusion**, we can say that the plan was successful. ✅

> He is **in debt**. ✅

> He spoke **in anger**. ✅

> I travelled **by train**. ✅

---

### ⭐ Rule 52 Shortcut

> **Fixed/idiomatic phrase → No Article**

Remember:

> **on fire** ❌ not *on a fire*

> **by mistake** ❌ not *by a mistake*

> **in danger** ❌ not *in a danger*

> **in debt** ❌ not *in a debt*

